#: surveyapp/templates/endsurvey.html:8
msgid "Your Results"
msgstr "Vaši rezultati"

#: surveyapp/templates/endsurvey.html:108
msgid "Challenge Complete! Thank you for your response!"
msgstr "Izziv končan! Hvala za vaš odgovor!"

#: surveyapp/templates/endsurvey.html:115
msgid ""
"Congratulations on completing the challenge to identify fake AI-manipulated "
"faces!"
msgstr "Čestitke za dokončanje izziva prepoznavanja lažnih obrazov, manipuliranih z umetno inteligenco!"

#: surveyapp/templates/endsurvey.html:121
msgid "Correct Answers"
msgstr "Pravilni odgovori"

#: surveyapp/templates/endsurvey.html:129
msgid "Accuracy"
msgstr "Natančnost"

#: surveyapp/templates/endsurvey.html:142
msgid "Detective Rank"
msgstr "Detektivski rang"

#: surveyapp/templates/endsurvey.html:161
msgid "What You've Learned"
msgstr "Kaj ste se naučili"

#: surveyapp/templates/endsurvey.html:163
msgid ""
"\n"
"                    This challenge tested your ability to identify AI-"
"generated fake faces. \n"
"                    The technology behind these images is constantly "
"improving, making detection increasingly difficult.\n"
"\n"
"                    This is part of a masters thesis project at Faculty for "
"Computer and Information Science at University of Ljubljana.\n"
"                    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"                    Ta izziv je preizkusil vašo sposobnost prepoznavanja lažnih obrazov, ustvarjenih z umetno inteligenco. \n"
"                    Tehnologija za temi slikami se nenehno izboljšuje, zaradi česar je odkrivanje vse težje.\n"
"\n"
"                    To je del magistrskega projekta na Fakulteti za računalništvo in informatiko Univerze v Ljubljani.\n"
"                    "

#: surveyapp/templates/endsurvey.html:175
msgid "Try Again"
msgstr "Poskusi znova"

#: surveyapp/templates/entrancePage.html:7
#: surveyapp/templates/entrancePage.html:139
msgid "Deepfake Challenge"
msgstr "Deepfake Izziv"

#: surveyapp/templates/entrancePage.html:140
msgid "Test your ability to detect AI-manipulated images"
msgstr ""
"Preizkusite svojo sposobnost zaznavanja slik, manipuliranih z umetno "
"inteligenco"

#: surveyapp/templates/entrancePage.html:149
msgid "Perception Test"
msgstr "Test Zaznavanja"

#: surveyapp/templates/entrancePage.html:150
msgid ""
"Challenge your ability to distinguish between real and AI-manipulated images."
msgstr ""
"Preizkusite svojo sposobnost razlikovanja med resničnimi in z umetno "
"inteligenco manipuliranimi slikami."

#: surveyapp/templates/entrancePage.html:156
msgid "Intuition Training"
msgstr "Trening Intuicije"

#: surveyapp/templates/entrancePage.html:157
msgid "Develop your intuition for spotting inconsistencies in fake images."
msgstr "Razvijte svojo intuicijo za odkrivanje nedoslednosti v lažnih slikah."

#: surveyapp/templates/entrancePage.html:163
msgid ""
"\n"
"                This is a part of a master thesis project at <strong>Faculty "
"of Computer and Information Science at University of Ljubljana</strong> (<a "
"href=\"https://www.fri.uni-lj.si/en/\" style=\"color: inherit; text-"
"decoration: none; box-shadow: none;\">https://www.fri.uni-lj.si/en/</a>), "
"where the goal is to create a deepfake face detector that utilizes human "
"perception. Your responses help us gather insights into visual cues, "
"confidence levels, and perceived inconsistencies. The data about human "
"intuition from this challenge will be combined with machine learning, to "
"build a model that learns not just from pixels, but from human perception "
"itself. <strong>All responses are anonymous</strong>.\n"
"                "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"                To je del magistrskega projekta na <strong>Fakulteti za "
"računalništvo in informatiko Univerze v Ljubljani</strong> (<a "
"href=\"https://www.fri.uni-lj.si/sl/\" style=\"color: inherit; text-"
"decoration: none; box-shadow: none;\">https://www.fri.uni-lj.si/sl/</a>), "
"katerega cilj je ustvariti detektor deepfake obrazov, ki uporablja človeško "
"zaznavanje. Vaši odgovori nam pomagajo zbirati vpoglede v vizualne namige, "
"stopnje zaupanja in zaznane nedoslednosti. Podatki o človeški intuiciji iz "
"tega izziva bodo združeni s strojnim učenjem, da bi zgradili model, ki se "
"uči ne le iz slikovnih točk, temveč tudi iz človeškega zaznavanja. "
"<strong>Vsi odgovori so anonimni</strong>.\n"
"                "

#: surveyapp/templates/entrancePage.html:168
msgid ""
"\n"
"                Pairs of images will be shown where one image is real and "
"the other has inconsistencies typical for deepfake images. They represent "
"the same face but one was transformed using random transformations to "
"resemble a fake image. <strong>Your task is to select the fake image and "
"answer some questions about your decision</strong>. The application is "
"configured for computer so it's best if you use it for your response.\n"
"                "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"                Prikazani bodo pari slik, kjer je ena slika resnična, druga "
"pa ima nedoslednosti, značilne za deepfake slike. Predstavljajo isti obraz, "
"vendar je bil eden preoblikovan z naključnimi transformacijami, da bi bil "
"podoben lažni sliki. <strong>Vaša naloga je izbrati lažno sliko in "
"odgovoriti na nekaj vprašanj o vaši odločitvi</strong>. Aplikacija je "
"konfigurirana za računalnik, zato je najbolje, da jo uporabljate za svoj "
"odgovor.\n"
"                "

#: surveyapp/templates/entrancePage.html:178
msgid "Start Challenge"
msgstr "Začni Izziv"

#: surveyapp/templates/exampleTask.html:8
msgid "Example Demonstration Task"
msgstr "Primer demonstracijske naloge"

#: surveyapp/templates/exampleTask.html:39
msgid "Example Task"
msgstr "Primer naloge"

#: surveyapp/templates/exampleTask.html:41
msgid ""
"\n"
"        <p>Here is an example question, with two face images where one is "
"real and one is fake.</p>\n"
"        The example answers demonstrate how the questions may be answered. "
"The inconsistencies might be difficult to spot but if you have a feeling "
"\"something is off\" mark it on the grid.\n"
"        Please <b>answer the actual questions in whichever way you think is "
"most relevant.</b>\n"
"\n"
"        <p>To select multiple squares, click and drag your mouse over them. "
"To hide the grid, simply click outside the image. Your selected squares will "
"be saved and shown again when you return to the image. If you change your "
"mind while selecting, no problem — just switch to another image and make "
"your selections there. You don't need to unselect anything!</p>\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"        <p>Tukaj je primer vprašanja z dvema slikama obrazov, kjer je ena resnična in ena lažna.</p>\n"
"        Primeri odgovorov prikazujejo, kako lahko odgovorite na vprašanja. Nedoslednosti so morda težko opazne, vendar če imate občutek, da \"nekaj ni v redu\", to označite na mreži.\n"
"        Prosimo, <b>na dejanska vprašanja odgovorite na način, ki se vam zdi najbolj primeren.</b>\n"
"\n"
"        <p>Za izbiro več kvadratkov kliknite in povlecite miško čez njih. Za skrivanje mreže preprosto kliknite zunaj slike. Vaši izbrani kvadratki bodo shranjeni in ponovno prikazani, ko se vrnete na sliko. Če si premislite med izbiranjem, ni problema - preprosto preklopite na drugo sliko in tam naredite svoje izbire. Ničesar vam ni treba odznačiti!</p>\n"
"        "

#: surveyapp/templates/exampleTask.html:53 surveyapp/templates/page1.html:139
msgid ""
"Select the fake image. Select parts of the image (squares) that seem off."
msgstr "Izberite lažno sliko. Izberite dele slike (kvadratke), ki se zdijo nenavadni."

#: surveyapp/templates/exampleTask.html:75 surveyapp/templates/page1.html:170
msgid "What did you observe in the fake image?"
msgstr "Kaj ste opazili na lažni sliki?"

