msgstr "Stran za seznanitev"

#: surveyapp/templates/introfamiliarization.html:15
msgid "Introductory Familiarization"
msgstr "Uvodna seznanitev"

#: surveyapp/templates/introfamiliarization.html:20
msgid ""
"\n"
"    <br>\n"
"    Below are twenty examples of these <b>AI-generated images</b>.\n"
"    <br><br>Again, <b>these images feature the faces of people who do not "
"exist</b>.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"    <br><br><br><br>In the main question sequence, you will be <b>tested on "
"your ability to distinguish these images from images of faces of people who "
"do exist</b>. <br><br><br><br>\n"
"    <b>Please study these carefully.</b> <br><br><br><br>\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"    <br>\n"
"    Spodaj je dvajset primerov teh <b>slik, ustvarjenih z umetno inteligenco</b>.\n"
"    <br><br>Ponovno, <b>te slike prikazujejo obraze ljudi, ki ne obstajajo</b>.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"    <br><br><br><br>V glavnem zaporedju vprašanj boste <b>preizkušeni v svoji sposobnosti razlikovanja teh slik od slik obrazov ljudi, ki dejansko obstajajo</b>. <br><br><br><br>\n"
"    <b>Prosimo, da jih skrbno preučite.</b> <br><br><br><br>\n"
"    "

#: surveyapp/templates/introfamiliarization.html:128
msgid "Asymmetries"
msgstr "Asimetrije"

#: surveyapp/templates/introfamiliarization.html:133
msgid "Background"
msgstr "Ozadje"

#: surveyapp/templates/introfamiliarization.html:138
msgid "Weirdness (/Abnormalities)"
msgstr "Čudnost (/Nepravilnosti)"

#: surveyapp/templates/introhelp.html:8
msgid "Help Page"
msgstr "Stran za pomoč"

#: surveyapp/templates/introhelp.html:15
msgid "Introductory Help"
msgstr "Uvodna pomoč"

#: surveyapp/templates/introhelp.html:17
msgid ""
"\n"
"        <p>Below are examples of some \"tell-tale\" features that the <b>AI-"
"manipulated images</b> tend to exhibit.</p>\n"
"\n"
"        <p>The inconsistencies are divided into four categories:<b> Color, "
"Boundary, Texture and Landmark.</b> Note that they can appear "
"<b>individually</b> or in <b>any combination</b>.</p>\n"
"\n"
"        <p>In the main question sequence, you will be <b>tested on your "
"ability to distinguish manipulated images from real images</b>.</p>\n"
"\n"
"        <p><b>Please study these carefully.</b></p>\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"        <p>Spodaj so primeri nekaterih \"izdajalskih\" značilnosti, ki jih <b>slike, manipulirane z umetno inteligenco</b>, pogosto kažejo.</p>\n"
"\n"
"        <p>Nedoslednosti so razdeljene v štiri kategorije:<b> Barva, Meja, Tekstura in Značilnost.</b> Upoštevajte, da se lahko pojavijo <b>posamično</b> ali v <b>kakršnikoli kombinaciji</b>.</p>\n"
"\n"
"        <p>V glavnem zaporedju vprašanj boste <b>preizkušeni v svoji sposobnosti razlikovanja manipuliranih slik od resničnih slik</b>.</p>\n"
"\n"
"        <p><b>Prosimo, da jih skrbno preučite.</b></p>\n"
"        "

#: surveyapp/templates/introhelp.html:41
